<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-RICHMOND SIGN ARGENTINE SCRUM-HALF PICHOT.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-RICHMOND SIGN ARGENTINE SCRUM-HALF PICHOT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second division English club Richmond have signed Argentine scrum-half Augustin Pichot as their 13th international.</p>
<p>Pichot, 22, has played 10 times for his country.</p>
